# YARD configuration for contractful.
#
# `yard doc` / `yard server` render the public API from the lib/ sources;
# the README and history are included as narrative files so rubydoc.info
# (which reads this file) shows the same set. Markdown rendering needs the
# redcarpet gem (development group, require: false).
--markup markdown
--markup-provider redcarpet
--no-private
--protected
--embed-mixins
lib/**/*.rb
-
README.md
history.md
